    "perplexity": {
      "description": "The Pet Sounds Sessions Highlights is a 2026 Beach Boys release that revisits Brian Wilson’s 1966 masterpiece Pet Sounds through a curated selection of session material, alternate versions, and a cappella performances. Issued by Capitol Records and UMe, it draws from the long-out-of-print 1997 The Pet Sounds Sessions box set and presents 25 tracks on 2LP or 2CD editions, making the studio process behind one of rock and pop’s most admired albums more accessible to casual listeners and collectors alike.\n\nThe original Pet Sounds remains the centerpiece: a landmark blend of pop sophistication, rock experimentation, and rich vocal harmony that helped redefine what a popular album could be. The highlights set adds revealing context with vocals-only takes, tracking-date excerpts, and alternate mixes, underscoring Wilson’s meticulous arranging and the Beach Boys’ evolving sound while preserving the emotional beauty and studio craft that made the album so influential.",
